    {
      "number": 3380,
      "text": "Each of them We seized for their sin: against some of them We sent a storm of stones[11]; some were seized by a blast[12]; some We caused the earth to swallow[13]; and some We drowned[14]. It was not Allah Who wronged them, but it was they who wronged themselves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 401,
      "ruku": 345,
      "hizbQuarter": 160,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3381,
      "text": "The likeness of those who take protectors other than Allah is that of a spider spinning a house. Indeed, the flimsiest of houses is the house of a spider[15], if only they knew.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 401,
      "ruku": 345,
      "hizbQuarter": 160,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3382,
      "text": "Allah knows whatever they call upon besides Him. He is the All-Mighty, the All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 401,
      "ruku": 345,
      "hizbQuarter": 160,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3383,
      "text": "Such are the comparisons We set forth for people, but none will understand them except the people of knowledge.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
        "numberOfAyahs": 69,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 401,
      "ruku": 345,
      "hizbQuarter": 160,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3384,
      "text": "Allah created the heavens and earth for a true purpose. Indeed, there is a sign in this for the believers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 29,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَنكَبُوتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ankaboot",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spider",
