      "hizbQuarter": 160,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3385,
      "text": "Recite [O Prophet] what is revealed to you of the Book, and establish prayer, for indeed prayer restrains one from immoral acts and wickedness[16]. Indeed, the remembrance of Allah is of greater merit. And Allah knows all what you do.",
